# CodeGraph documentation

Before changing architecture, MCP tools, retrieval, CLI, or graph behavior:

1. Read [docs/README.md](docs/README.md) and follow links to the relevant guide or reference page.
2. Treat [DECISIONS.md](DECISIONS.md) as current design context (update it when you change defaults or surfaces).
3. Use [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for MCP workflow; use [docs/guides/cookbook.md](docs/guides/cookbook.md) for command recipes.

**Do not** treat `docs/CodeGraphContext-Docs-From-Github/` or an external CodeGraphContext checkout as authoritative for this repo.

When code and docs disagree, fix the docs in the same change set. See [docs/UPDATING_DOCS.md](docs/UPDATING_DOCS.md).
